{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A True Struggle for Survival</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slow-paced, atmosphere-driven gameplay combines exploration, looting, and vehicle upgrading mechanics. Players can scavenge resources from abandoned structures, interact with the environment, and gradually transform their vehicle into a lifeline that carries them toward freedom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836380/extras/78f83a99e6f539b12b46d08ffebad021.poster.avif?t=1765203750\" width=1170 height=652 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836380/extras/78f83a99e6f539b12b46d08ffebad021.webm?t=1765203750\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836380/extras/78f83a99e6f539b12b46d08ffebad021.mp4?t=1765203750\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Interactive First-Person Experience</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Post-Apocalyptic Atmosphere:</strong> Collapsed cities, ruined structures, and irradiated wastelands.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vehicle-Based Survival:</strong> Repair, upgrade, and customize your vehicle to increase your chances of survival.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Independent AI Third Arm:</strong> Your unusual companion can interact with the environment, assist in combat, and execute the tasks you command.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dangerous Enemies:</strong> Battle against mutated creatures in a fight for survival.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rich Loot System:</strong> Gather resources, craft equipment, and upgrade your vehicle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Freedom Beyond the Walls:</strong> Can you escape the dark quarantine zone?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836380/extras/a0046abc1d9d64a4e1695e0309beb1c7.poster.avif?t=1765203750\" width=1170 height=654 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836380/extras/a0046abc1d9d64a4e1695e0309beb1c7.webm?t=1765203750\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836380/extras/a0046abc1d9d64a4e1695e0309beb1c7.mp4?t=1765203750\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Who Is It For?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect for players who enjoy survival, exploration, and post-apocalyptic settings. Ideal for those seeking atmospheric experiences, resource management, and the constant tension of staying alive under relentless threats.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Visual Style</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game blends modern graphics with a grim and striking post-apocalyptic aesthetic. Collapsed buildings, heavy fog effects, and the unsettling presence of radiation keep the player on edge at every moment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836380/extras/611986ec1df582a5de30891e52374f72.poster.avif?t=1765203750\" width=1170 height=654 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836380/extras/611986ec1df582a5de30891e52374f72.webm?t=1765203750\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836380/extras/611986ec1df582a5de30891e52374f72.mp4?t=1765203750\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3836380?t=1765203750","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3836380?t=1765203750","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836380/8404860001ef91b15e03e8cad43c61da522e341f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765203750","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836380/8404860001ef91b15e03e8cad43c61da522e341f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765203750","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game contains sudden jumpscares, a dark and intense atmosphere, and a horror story inspired by real-life events. It may be disturbing to some players."},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A True Struggle for Survival</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slow-paced, atmosphere-driven gameplay combines exploration, looting, and vehicle upgrading mechanics. Players can scavenge resources from abandoned structures, interact with the environment, and gradually transform their vehicle into a lifeline that carries them toward freedom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836380/extras/78f83a99e6f539b12b46d08ffebad021.poster.avif?t=1765203750\" width=1170 height=652 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836380/extras/78f83a99e6f539b12b46d08ffebad021.webm?t=1765203750\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836380/extras/78f83a99e6f539b12b46d08ffebad021.mp4?t=1765203750\" type=\"video/mp4\"