 alive under relentless threats.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Visual Style</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game blends modern graphics with a grim and striking post-apocalyptic aesthetic. Collapsed buildings, heavy fog effects, and the unsettling presence of radiation keep the player on edge at every moment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836380/extras/611986ec1df582a5de30891e52374f72.poster.avif?t=1765203750\" width=1170 height=654 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836380/extras/611986ec1df582a5de30891e52374f72.webm?t=1765203750\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836380/extras/611986ec1df582a5de30891e52374f72.mp4?t=1765203750\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","developers":["Legions Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836380/e6addbfa3295eaadb13f97196d53e32514653c33/header.jpg?t=1765203750","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Trust Me","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-2300 | AMD FX-6350<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8  GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 650 Ti, 2 GB | AMD Radeon R7 360, 2 GB<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Legions Studio"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Viol\u00eancia Extrema\nLinguagem impr\u00f3pria\nMedo","rating":"18","rating_generated":"1","required_age":